editor_description = "One lightning bolt. CallLightning (gsba) and the discharges of LightningCharge (gcil) add it to the shot container, on the server only. It bounces on the first body in the way (retarget, the shooter left out) and after travel_s deals direct spell damage with the LIGHTNING mod; the look is FxBus.broadcast_beam. It frees itself on the hit."
